      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0007:0001",
      "source": "Creates an AVLegibleMediaOptionsMenuController with an optional player",
      "ko": "선택적 player를 사용해 AVLegibleMediaOptionsMenuController를 생성합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "34f65fb940e39e6a46275c827644106f8614b0c884d786b0c4477767c5b74218",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "When player is non-nil, both media tracks and caption appearance options will be included, otherwise, only caption appearance options.",
      "ko": "The first [`rank`](bnnstensor/rank.md) elements specify the size of each dimension.",
      "sourceHash": "eb8dba779507afff5a2dd1185b5e414fd080e863e3a2798bdb2bddaaea605169",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
